  "description": "Newly Refurbished 3-Bedroom 3-Bathroom, Family Home with Detached Garage | The Highlands, Drogheda, Co. Meath\n\nAvailable from 13th October 2026 | €2,500 per month. Early enquiries are recommended.\n\nSet in the popular Highlands development in Drogheda, Co. Meath, this well-proportioned three-bedroom, three-bathroom home offers comfortable living with the benefit of a detached garage, private decking, and a mature back garden. \n                                                                                                                                The property is currently being refurbished throughout, with a new kitchen, new heating system, fresh paint, and new carpet, ready to welcome its next tenants. The living room and kitchen come furnished, while all bedrooms are unfurnished; the living area furniture can also be removed if a tenant prefers the home fully unfurnished.\n\nThe property is just 5 minutes from the M1 motorway, providing convenient access to Dublin and beyond, and is approximately 40 km from Dublin Airport. Perfect for commuters to Dublin and tenants seeking additional storage or hobby space through the detached garage.\nOne of the standout features of this location is its proximity to Oldbridge House & Estate, offering beautiful parklands, riverside walks and scenic outdoor spaces just a short stroll away.\n\nKey features\n•\t2 double bedrooms, one with ensuite bathroom\n•\t1 single bedroom or office\n•\tBedrooms unfurnished. All have built in wardrobes\n•\tBright sitting room\n•\tOpen-plan kitchen/dining area\n•\tFurnished living room and kitchen (furniture can be removed on request for a fully unfurnished home)\n•\t3 bathrooms in total\n•\tDetached garage\n•\tDecking area and mature back garden\n•\tOff-street parking\n•\tSide access\n•\tExcellent commuter location with easy access to the M1 motorway\n\nSuperb Location. \nIdeally located within walking distance of:\n•\tDrogheda Town Centre\n•\tPrimary and secondary schools\n•\tShops, cafés and local amenities\n•\tSports and leisure facilities\n\nAvailability\nAvailable from 9th October 2026, with the move-in date flexible for the right tenant. \n\nTo arrange a viewing or make an enquiry, please get in touch directly. A deposit plus first month's rent is required to secure the property. \n\nWe look forward to hearing from you. Updated photographs of the refurbishment will be uploaded as works are completed.",
